  "body": "(Originally reported by @TimothyGu)\r\n\r\nThe diagram in <https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/introduction.html#abstract> lists a bunch of web techs that all mash together to form HTML-the-platform. One of the prominent ones listed right along the top is NPAPI, a historical and currently deprecated-by-everyone technology. It's not exactly emblematic of a necessary piece of the web.\r\n\r\nTimothy suggests replacing it with ServiceWorker; I don't have any suggestions.\r\n\r\nLuckily the diagram is a simple SVG, so it's very easy to edit.",
